WEBVTT

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:40.730
Almayce, a visitor from the
Overworld, is trying to summon...

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:43.830
...the dark lord
Darkstar to our world!

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:47.180
Because of this, he's
after the Sword of Light...

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.210
...one of five weapons
created by Darkstar...

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:53.110
...as well as one other hidden
somewhere in this world.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:06.730
You really think that Darkstar weapon
Almayce is after is in this kingdom?

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.820
I don't know if it's
the Darkstar weapon...

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.490
...but the kingdom of Alto
and its neighbor, Baritone...

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.940
...are said to possess
legendary magical vessels.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:18.300
So, Alto has a legendary
magical vessel, all told?

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.400
Ooh, that one
was just terrible!

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.710
Darn it...

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.150
What's up?
Is everyone taking a siesta?

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:45.430
I beg your pardon.
It's time for us to close.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.900
Why? I haven't even
gotten my order yet.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:51.240
Forgive me. We look
forward to serving you later.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.990
What's going on?!

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.030
It's a cannon.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:23.840
It uses gunpowder to
launch a giant ball at a target.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:27.310
I can SEE that!
What I want to know is...

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:34.780
Gourry!

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:38.820
What gives?!
It's dark in here! Help me!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.010
Xellos! I know you're
around here somewhere!

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.650
Come out and give us a hand!

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.990
Umm... Even if you say that...

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:48.860
...I can't come running
just because you call me, right?

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.090
You useless!

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.770
It looks like a war's
just suddenly broken out!

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:34.140
I know splitting up to look for the
magical vessels was a good idea...

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.740
...but now we can't get
to Miss Lina and the others!

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.540
Well... I wonder
what's going on here.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:44.450
Are you people strangers here?
This always happens.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.850
Always happens?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:50.550
Yes. Our kingdom of Baritone
and its neighbor, Alto...

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:54.360
...have been at
war for ages now.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:05:00.170
Every day around noon, we exchange
a little fire. It'll be over soon.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.140
Each side knows where
the other's shots will land...

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:08.010
...so there's never
that much damage.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:13.280
It's more of a daily
annoyance than an actual war.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.840
Ah, the foolishness of it...

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:19.290
I've never seen such
a casually-run war before.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:24.020
Well, casual or not,
it's definitely wrong to do this!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.590
However... It's none of
our business is it?

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:28.790
Mr. Xellos?!

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:31.390
That's right.
Our objective here...

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.400
...is to find this
kingdom's magical vessel.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:34.840
Mr. Zelgadis, you, too?!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.870
From what I've heard, Baritone
possesses a black magical vessel...

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:44.710
...while Alto possesses
a white magical one.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.910
They appear to have
become each kingdom's color.

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:47.920
Their color?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.950
Well, call it the
character of each kingdom.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:55.860
Alto follows the philosophy of high
ideals while Baritone goes for results.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.160
So, does that make
Baritone here the bad guys?

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.330
Oh, I wouldn't
say that at all.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:05.330
And you can't say if following
high ideals is correct, either.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.390
Reality tends to demand
a mixture of the two.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:17.780
There's an old legend here that,
if both vessels are brought together...

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.040
...a new road will be opened.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.210
That's apparently why each
kingdom is trying so hard...

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:24.880
...to get the other's vessel.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:28.210
But we won't know if that's
talking about the Darkstar weapon...

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.450
...until we see it with our
own eyes. How do we do that?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.260
The everclosed eyes are opening!

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:39.990
What?

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:57.550
I see... It seems to be
reacting to my magical power.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:59.520
Oh! It's a miracle!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.120
Wh- What's going on?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:02.850
Who knows?

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:12.460
M- Maybe we should get away
from where the shells are falling.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:13.660
Yeah...

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.270
HEY! Cut it out, already!

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.400
I don't think they can hear
you shouting from here.

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.210
In that case...

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:27.950
Incoming! Incoming! Incoming!
It's coming right for us!

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:31.190
BOM DI WI ND!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.800
I think you sent
that shot into the!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.600
Um... Hold on, here!

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:10.280
Hey! What did we do?!

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.230
We haven't even done
anything yet, right?!

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.490
What do you mean "yet?!"

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.730
This is the second time I've
been thrown into a prison.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.430
It looks like I'm gradually
becoming a terrible person!

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.240
Are these the ones?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:35.480
The people who knocked a
cannonball into my palace?!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.210
Yes, sir! Apparently!

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:41.780
Look, I didn't mean to!
It was bad luck! An accident!

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:44.360
Then I will ask you.
For what reason...

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:46.830
...did you people come
to the kingdom of Alto?

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:50.570
Huh? Well... You see...

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:57.210
Welcome to the
kingdom of Baritone!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:00.730
Please! Eat all you want and
make yourselves at home!

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:06.480
Well, this has sure taken
a strange turn, hasn't it?

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:07.280
Yeah.

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:10.180
Still... They've gone through
so much trouble to invite us.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.090
Go on!
Why did you come to Alto?!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:19.790
Um, well... It was sorta...

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:20.990
What's wrong, Lina?

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:26.460
Oh-ho, did you forget what
we came here for? I didn't!

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:29.870
It was to get the
magical vessels, right?!

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:30.840
You idiot!

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:36.210
That makes us sound like a bunch
of criminals, jellyfish brains!

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.750
What did I say wrong?!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:41.750
Well, then, you can stay
locked up in there for now!

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:45.650
Agh! Wait a sec!
It's not what you think!

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.660
When he said we
were here to get them...

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:50.060
...he meant we were just here
to talk with you about them!

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:52.030
Can't we discuss this?
We weren't here to steal them!

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.120
Although I won't rule that out...

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:59.060
Anyway, I'm begging you, here!
Listen to me! Please! Come on!

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:01.800
Come on, give us a break! Hey!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.690
Lord Valgaav...

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:36.860
What'll we do, Boss?

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:43.380
We won't betray him, no matter
what. Lord Valgaav is my!

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:09.030
Do you want revenge,
my oppressed beast man friend?

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.340
Of course I do...

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:16.170
Then I shall take
your life in my hands.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:24.150
Lord Valgaav... This time,
I swear I won't fail you.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.400
So... What do you
want to talk to us about?

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:49.200
Well, I have a
favor to ask of you.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:50.270
A favor?

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:54.370
Our kingdom has possessed a
black magical vessel for a long time.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.500
The kingdom of Alto, who hates
us for some reason...

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:58.570
...has a white magical vessel.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:02.050
We've already heard about that.
It's famous, apparently.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.950
Then let's go
straight to the matter.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:09.210
You people are able to
use magic. Am I correct?

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:16.830
Then it should be a simple
matter for you to get Alto's vessel.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:22.570
In other words, you want us to
steal Alto's magical vessel for you.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.500
Must you put it so bluntly?

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.810
Of course, you will be
handsomely rewarded.

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:33.480
We weren't prepared at all
for a request for thievery.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:36.620
You must be joking!
The queen of a kingdom...

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:40.050
...asking a group of strangers to
steal for her is outrageous!

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.250
What did you say?!

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:45.430
Your Highness, you... are... WRONG!

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:53.330
Someone who dares to defy
my mother. You're so brave!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.260
Marco!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:00.170
I'm hungry!
This isn't enough for us!

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.100
It tastes bad!

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:04.170
Think so? I kinda like it.

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:05.640
I'm busting out!

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:06.940
BAM ROHD!

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:13.050
Please, don't! Don't make this
situation worse than it is!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.350
Hey! Why'd you stop me?!

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:18.520
If you did that, even if we ran,
they'd send soldiers after us!

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:21.190
And if they do, I'll blow the
kingdom away with a Dragon Slave!

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:23.360
We happen to be I NNOCENT!

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:25.200
There's no need to
commit any crimes!

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:29.100
What are you talking about?!
Go back to your temple!

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.470
You stubborn!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.440
Okay, guys. Calm down.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:33.200
Excuse me.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:37.640
I'm Sera, the princess
of this kingdom.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.270
The truth is,
I have a favor for you.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:42.210
Please... Save us!

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:49.820
I demand you say that again!
I... I'm wrong, you say?!

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:54.830
Sorry, but sticking your nose into
a war between kingdoms is stupid.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.800
Well, I have to agree with that.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.460
It's been a pleasure.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:01.800
YOU I MPERTI NENT!

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.940
Please wait.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.830
Sorry, but you won't be
able to change our minds.

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:10.040
No, this isn't about
what my mother asked.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:13.510
There's another favor
I want to ask of you.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.780
You all must have heard already.

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:22.220
How Baritone and Alto have
been at war for a long time.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.620
And how it's because each
wants the other's magical vessel.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:27.490
So, what do you want us to do?

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:32.390
If both of the vessels disappear,
the reason for the war vanishes.

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:36.430
Once that happens, I think both
kingdoms will finally make peace.

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:37.470
In other words...

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:41.810
...you want us to steal Baritone's
vessel, not your neighbor's.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.710
But what about the vessel in Alto?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.710
Right! Sera's handling that.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:48.080
Sera?

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.650
Save you?

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:55.080
Um, look. That's what we
should be asking YOU.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.380
You're thieves, right?

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:02.660
Now look! We aren't thieves,
demolition experts, or terrorists, either!

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.820
I made a promise to Marco.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.660
Who's Marco?
Is this kid even listening to me?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:13.570
For our future, we have to get
those magical vessels ourselves!

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:19.210
But I could never steal it myself.
That's why I'm asking you!

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.810
Please! For the sake
of my love for Marco!

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:24.180
Please steal the magical vessel!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:25.810
For your love?

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:28.820
Oh! How worthy a request!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:29.650
Hey!

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.660
Not many guards
around here, are there?

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:46.170
Actually, anyone who steps on the
floor here will set off an alarm.

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:47.000
I see...

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.710
That trap's meaningless to us!

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.130
RAYWI NG!

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:57.580
Wait for me!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.990
Wow! Wow!
You're really great thieves!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.390
Um, we aren't
thieves, you know...

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.630
Is it in here?

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:13.690
Yes. But there are
traps in there, too.

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.470
Holy! Look at all of them!

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:20.700
Oh, jeez!
Where do you even start?

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:24.180
If we loosen them one by one,
we'll be here till morning.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:28.580
You can't! If you don't do it
carefully, an alarm will go off!

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:33.350
Oh! This will be fine.
I'm an expert at cat's cradle.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.060
Look! A broom!
A boat! An onion!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.020
You say the vessel's in here?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:41.930
Yes.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.230
If this was sealed with a spell,
I'd have no problem.

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:49.860
But it uses a mechanical device...
This might be a bit tricky.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:50.770
How do you open it?

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:54.800
I don't know. That's why
I asked you to do it.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:55.970
No choice, then.

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.950
Miss Lina, bring that
chain to the right!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:05.610
Mr. Gourry, pull this chain
straight through there!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.820
Hey, quit bossing me!
Oh, why do I have to do this?

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.580
Hey, you think
YOU have problems!

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:47.660
Mr. Zelgadis, where did
you learn that?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.630
A long time ago.
It's a long story.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.230
It's open.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.740
It's the magical vessel!

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:06.810
Come on! Let's get out of here!
Follow me, please!

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.610
Hold it right there!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.310
Do something about this!

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:11.680
Let us out!

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.390
Oh, my.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.960
Th- This is the
legendary magical vessel?

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.020
Yes. Come on, everyone.
No need to wait around now!

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:30.400
Great. They already found out.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.840
That way! To that
deserted island! Hurry!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.310
They've found out!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.140
This way!

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.370
Where do you plan on running to?

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:46.220
What?! The vessel's been stolen?!

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:49.880
F- Forgive me, Highness!
Also, Prince Marco is!

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:53.980
An Alto trick... Send out
the soldiers at once!

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.230
The vessel's been stolen?!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:57.960
Yes, sir! Not just that!

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:00.870
They've also kidnapped
Princess Sera!

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:05.840
As I thought!
They were Baritone agents!

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:08.570
After them!
Don't let them escape!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:28.260
Okay, we're here.
Now what are we going to do?

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:29.730
Sera!

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:31.090
Marco!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.220
Sera!

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.200
Marco! You finally did it!

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.600
Yeah! How about you?

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.200
I had these thieves help me!

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:44.340
By thieves, does she mean
you STOLE it, Miss Lina?!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.610
Oh, come on!
What about you guys?

00:19:46.820 --> 00:19:50.410
Th- That's absolutely not true!
Right, Master Marco?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:55.420
Exactly! It's because of these that
Alto and Baritone are at war!

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:58.480
So we believe in the legend!

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:01.320
We're going to make a
new future for ourselves here!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:06.260
And then Marco and I will be
able to realize our love!

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.300
Oh, my!

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:10.630
Realize your love?
You're just little kids!

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:15.170
HO-O-O-OLD EVERYTHI NG!
You're not getting away!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.710
Now what?!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.470
Miss Lina! There are more
coming from that way!

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.680
Oh, man...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.080
If there are any legendary
magical vessels here...

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.220
...I'LL be the one
who takes them!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.630
And also...

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.170
...you can hand over the
Sword of Light, as well.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:51.380
Now, of all times, THEY show up!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.340
<i>The situation's turned critical!
Things can't get any worse!</i>

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.890
<i>And this is how they're
ending the episode?!</i>

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.850
<i>Oh, for crying out loud,
I hate it when they pull this!</i>

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:26.540
Marco! Sera!
What are you doing?!

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:29.080
Why do you want to break
those magical vessels?!

